{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-3","name":"通行人","text":"Excuse me","trans":"不好意思","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010040","name":"恋鐘","text":"あ、霧子～！\r\nお疲れさ──","trans":"啊，雾子～！\n辛苦啦——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010050","name":"霧子","text":"……？\r\n恋鐘ちゃん……？","trans":"……？\n恋钟……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010060","name":"摩美々","text":"さっき恋鐘が──","trans":"刚才恋钟她——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010070","name":"摩美々","text":"──さっきあったこと\r\n今から恋鐘がしゃべらずに説明しまぁす","trans":"——刚才发生的事\n现在就由恋钟不说话来解说～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010080","name":"恋鐘","text":"ふぇ～～、摩美々勝手に～！\r\nって、しゃべったらいけんかった～……","trans":"呜～～，摩美美你擅自～！\n啊，不能说话的～……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010100","name":"霧子","text":"見てて……\r\nいいの……？","trans":"看着……\n可以吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010110","name":"摩美々","text":"大丈夫ー","trans":"没问题——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010120","name":"恋鐘","text":"そいじゃあ、いくばい～！","trans":"那么，开始咯～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010130","name":"霧子","text":"窓……\r\nかな……？","trans":"是窗户……\n吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010140","name":"霧子","text":"歩く……","trans":"在走……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010150","name":"霧子","text":"恋鐘ちゃん……\r\n外……歩いてる……？","trans":"恋钟……\n在外面……走……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010160","name":"霧子","text":"口……\r\nいいえ……？","trans":"嘴……\n不对吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010180","name":"霧子","text":"静かに……\r\nしなきゃ……？","trans":"必须……\n保持安静……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010190","name":"恋鐘","text":"難しか～、\r\n摩美々～、助けて～！","trans":"好难啊～，\n摩美美～，救命～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010200","name":"摩美々","text":"えー","trans":"诶——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010230","name":"摩美々","text":"へーい、がーる\r\nえくすきゅーずみー","trans":"嗨——，姑娘\n不好意思——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010250","name":"摩美々","text":"おー\r\nそーりー、せんきゅー","trans":"哦——\n抱歉，谢谢——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010260","name":"霧子","text":"外で……\r\n外国の人に……道……","trans":"在外面……\n被外国人……问路……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010270","name":"霧子","text":"恋鐘ちゃんは……\r\nしゃべらない……","trans":"恋钟……\n不说话……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010280","name":"霧子","text":"しゃべれなかった……？","trans":"是说不出话……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010290","name":"霧子","text":"あ……\r\nジェスチャー……","trans":"啊……\n是手势……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010300","name":"恋鐘","text":"当たり～！","trans":"答对啦～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010310","name":"恋鐘","text":"うち、焦ってしまって\r\n助けになれんかったとよ～","trans":"我当时慌了神\n没能帮上忙呢～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010320","name":"恋鐘","text":"やけん、次は言葉の出てこんでも、\r\n身振り手振りで伝えられるようになりたか～って思って！","trans":"所以，下次就算说不出话，\n我也想能用动作手势传达～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010330","name":"霧子","text":"とても……\r\n素敵だね……","trans":"非常……\n很棒呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010340","name":"霧子","text":"わたしも……\r\n一緒に……","trans":"我也想……\n一起……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010350","name":"恋鐘","text":"じゃあ、３人でジェスチャークイズするばい～！","trans":"那么，三个人来玩手势猜谜吧～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010360","name":"摩美々","text":"私は回答専門でー","trans":"我专门负责回答——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010370","name":"摩美々","text":"それじゃー、第１問ー","trans":"那么——第一题——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010380","name":"霧子","text":"わたし……\r\nやります……","trans":"我……\n来比……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010400","name":"摩美々","text":"空……\r\n太陽ー？","trans":"天空……\n太阳——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010410","name":"恋鐘","text":"太陽の～？","trans":"太阳的～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010420","name":"摩美々","text":"笑ってる……？","trans":"在笑……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010430","name":"恋鐘","text":"笑う～は……元気か時～？\r\nあ、天気のよかねってことやろか～？","trans":"“笑”～就是……有精神的时候～？\n啊，是说天气好的意思吧～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010440","name":"霧子","text":"うん……\r\n正解だよ……","trans":"嗯……\n答对了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010450","name":"摩美々","text":"やるじゃーん","trans":"挺行的嘛——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010460","name":"恋鐘","text":"そいじゃあ、次はうちばい～！","trans":"那么，接下来是我啦～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010470","name":"霧子","text":"何か……\r\n切ってるのかな……？","trans":"是在……\n切什么东西吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010480","name":"摩美々","text":"恋鐘のことだし\r\n料理じゃないー？","trans":"毕竟是恋钟\n肯定是做菜吧——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010490","name":"摩美々","text":"何かを炒めて……","trans":"在炒什么……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010500","name":"霧子","text":"美味しく……\r\nできました……","trans":"做得……\n很好吃……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010510","name":"摩美々","text":"えー、正解じゃないのー？\r\n降参ー","trans":"诶——，不对吗——？\n我投降——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010520","name":"恋鐘","text":"降参の早うない？　正解は～\r\n『今日の夕飯はオムライスば食べるばい～』でした～！","trans":"投降得也太快了吧？　正确答案是～\n“今天的晚饭要吃蛋包饭啦～”～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010530","name":"摩美々","text":"……それは無理ー","trans":"……那不可能猜到——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010540","name":"霧子","text":"恋鐘ちゃんのオムライス……\r\n美味しそうだね……","trans":"恋钟的蛋包饭……\n好像很好吃……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010560","name":"恋鐘","text":"あ、摩美々～！","trans":"啊，摩美美～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010580","name":"霧子","text":"袖……\r\nかな……？","trans":"是袖子……\n吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010590","name":"摩美々","text":"恋鐘の袖ー？","trans":"恋钟的袖子——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010600","name":"摩美々","text":"私ー？","trans":"我——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010610","name":"摩美々","text":"あ、糸くず……","trans":"啊，线头……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010620","name":"恋鐘","text":"今度は正解～！\r\n『摩美々の袖に、糸のついとると～！』","trans":"这次答对了～！\n“摩美美的袖子上，粘着线头啦～”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008025010630","name":"摩美々","text":"そういうことは\r\n普通に言ってほしいんですケドー","trans":"这种事\n希望你能正常说出来啊——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}